                    <mxGeometry x="3960" y="990" width="370" height="57.5" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-120" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;该集合中已经有5个元素了,那5个呢？&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;CoreMainConfig：这个刚处理完，添加进去的&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;NotificationService：被CoreMainConfig通过@ComponentScan扫描到的&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;ProductService ：&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;被CoreMainConfig通过@ComponentScan扫描到的&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;DatabaseConfig ： 被CoreMainConfig通过@Import()直接导入的配置类&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;CacheConfig： 被CoreMainConfig通过@Import()导入的&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;MyImportSelector 所返回的配置类,需要立即解析&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="3197.5" y="1111.25" width="655" height="148.75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-121" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;可以看下这里的时机哦,很重要&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 这里的处理时机是在上面的for循环结束后,也即所有的配置类都解析完的情况下，再来处理的，这个时候几乎所有的组件变成了BeanDefinition了(比如@Component注解家族)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;但是需要注意的是：还有两种类型还没有处理&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 所有的@Bean标注的方法还没有处理&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 所有I&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;mportBeanDefinitionRegistrars直接进行注册的还没有处理&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=#FF3333;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2000" y="1101.25" width="580" height="108.75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-122" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad9d5;strokeColor=#ae4132;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1995" y="1230" width="385" height="148.75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-123" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorHolder&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2085" y="1230.6200000000001" width="240" height="28.75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-124" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelector&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;=&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportSelector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2055" y="1268.75" width="280" height="38.75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-125" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;configClass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot; color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;=&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;CoreMainConfig.class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2055" y="1320.0000000000002" width="280" height="38.75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-126" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;List&amp;lt;DeferredImportSelectorHolder&amp;gt; deferredImportSelectors = new ArrayList&amp;lt;&amp;gt;()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;在我写的demo中,这里只有一个,就是&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace;&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportSelector(当然被包装为了DeferredImportSelectorHolder)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2400" y="1290" width="690" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-127" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;处理流程：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorGroupingHandler handler = new DeferredImportSelectorGroupingHandler(); #创建一个处理器&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2. 排序&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;deferredImports.forEach(handler::register); # 相当于对每一个&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorHolder调用 handler.register(&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;deferredImportSelectorHolder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;handler.processGroupImports();&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2010" y="1410" width="1080" height="152.5" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-128" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-39" target="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-127" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-129" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;# register()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;1. group =&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;deferredImport.getImportSelector().getImportGroup() # 获取对应的分组(自己写的,在我的demo中返回的是&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportGroup.class&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;2. 然后会根据第1步返回的group，进行第二步处理,这里无非就是两种情况&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;2.1 group=null,也即无分组&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;2.2 group =&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportGroup.class，也即有分组&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;而这里有个lambda表达式,具体的操作等价于：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 以group作为key，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 去&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;groupings(&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Map&amp;lt;Object, DeferredImportSelectorGrouping&amp;gt; groupings = new LinkedHashMap&amp;lt;&amp;gt;()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;) 去获取对应的value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;- 如果 value = null，那么创建一个新的&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorGrouping 对象，然后存放进去&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;那么这会出现一个什么样的现象呢？&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 对于相同的group(getImportGroup()返回的)-key,对应的都是相同的value,也就是同一个&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorGrouping对象&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 对于group=null的情况,也就是没有分组的情况，那么每个对应的都是一个新的&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorGrouping对象&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;grouping.add(deferredImport); # 将&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;deferredImport添加到刚才创建的grouping对象&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="3197.5" y="1352.5" width="1022.5" height="267.5" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-130" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;这里有几个对象，容易搞混了，这里单独提出来说明一下&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#e3c800;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#B09500;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4230" y="1378.75" width="390" height="25" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-131" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;Map&amp;lt;Object, DeferredImportSelectorGrouping&amp;gt; groupings = new LinkedHashMap&amp;lt;&amp;gt;()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;作用:将所有DeferredImportSelector按照其Group类型进行分组，相同Group的选择器会被放在同一个分组中统一处理&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;key: 分组标识符(分为两种类型)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;1.Class&amp;lt;? extends Group&amp;gt;：自定义Group类（如AutoConfigurationGroup.class,&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportGroup.class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;2.DeferredImportSelectorHolder@xxx：没有Group的选择器holder对象&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;value: DeferredImportSelectorGrouping对象，包含该分组的所有选择器&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4230" y="1410" width="850" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-132" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportGroup.class -&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorGrouping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;@xxx&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4740" y="1500" width="480" height="70" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-133" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;DeferredImportSelectorGrouping grouping: 这个就是上面所指的value,内部有两个属性&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;private final DeferredImportSelector.Group group;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; // Group处理器实例 (在这里是&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;MyDeferredImportGroup实例&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;private final List&amp;lt;DeferredImportSelectorHolder&amp;gt; deferredImports;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;// 该分组的所有选择器(在这里目前只有1个)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4230" y="1570" width="850" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="pmoIR6_AIWQnp-MZ1eYm-134" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;Map&amp;lt;AnnotationMetadata, ConfigurationClass&amp;gt; configurationClasses = new HashMap&amp;lt;&amp;gt;() : 配置类映射表&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;Key：AnnotationMetadata（配置类的注解元数据）-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;导入&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;deferredImport的配置类的元数据信息(CoreMainConfig.class.metadata)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;value：ConfigurationClass（配置类对象）-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace;&quot;&gt;导入&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace;&quot;&gt;deferredImport的配置类(coreMainConfig.class)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#